WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open the blue account dropdown and choose User profile.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Choose a photo and check its square preview.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Press Save photo to apply it. Choosing a file alone does not save it.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: Use the photo removal control to return to initials when needed.
